    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on a spit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τι περὶ λόγχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Galb.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., <i>pierce</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτοὺς
				π. ὀδύναις</span> I<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Ti.</u>
				6.10
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be spitted</i> or <i>pierced</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφεσι καὶ λόγχαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.80
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάρακι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					19.84
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόλοπι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					7.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβελοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Gall.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., <i>to become entangled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσαναπορεύτοις βαράθροις περιπαρέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.672
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυα, οἷς ἀνάγκη περιπείρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.411
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				250.11
			</span></i>. </div>
